tags: [history-and-events]
---

After the Titan Bannet shaped the planet of Ashunet, he offered his body to the planet as its lands.

Hundreds years later, after the advent of civilization. His soul united ten kings. There and then, these fated few signed an accord under the Titan's guidance to carve and rule this continent.

In the following ages they would carve and collect lands of the continent, until their competition was destroyed. Yet the energy of Bannet had by this point been exhausted. As to construct a leadership, the title King of Kings was created. A cycle would determine who would hold this title. The holder would handover his title according to the cycle after a hundred years.

The remaining Kings meanwhile were able to hold different titles. Secondary to the King of Kings, seven more tiles existed. Each from a different element and represented by their birthstone in Bannet's Antitower. These seven titles were able to seperate themselves form the Decemvir Era after [[sorrows-dawn|Sorrow's Dawn]], due to their ties to the Elemental [[religions|Deities]]. This organization/system persists today as the Order of the Marked RIng.

Yet this age of prosperity and peace came to an end on [[sorrows-dawn|Sorrow's Dawn]]

These Empires were:
- [[naanuath-empire|Naanuath Empire]]
- [[vianis-river-delta|Cuthage Empire]] - *Vianis River Delta*
- [[praetia|Prantis Empire]] - *Praetia*
- [[kiseryn|Kiserian Empire]] - *Kiseryn*
- [[xoseon-steppes|Boghdan Khanate]] - *Xoseon Steppes*
- [[lairebais|Skornar Empire]] - *Lairebais*
- [[khegh-yaen|Yaennan Empire]] - *Khegh Yaen*
- [[ukrasha|Rashlan Empire]] - *Ukrasha*
- [[the-rift|Ulraizan Empire]] - *The Rift*
- [[himfahrum|Hoggrun Kingdom]] - *Himfahrum*
